   "summary": "IMobileEmail lives in the Emails UI flow (`IMobileFlow:Emails`, EmailTheme) and is sent by an ISendEmailNode in a server action (logic); IPopover is born complete (TopContent/BottomContent); IPopup is shown by its ShowPopup expression (a boolean variable toggled by screen actions); ITextMetadata hangs on a screen aggregate with managedBy. Traditional Web emails are IWebEmail (ui.traditional-screen).",
   "route": {
    "kind": "job",
    "operation": "create IMobileEmail in IMobileFlow:Emails; create IPopover | IPopup under a screen container; set ShowPopup/Subject; ISendEmailNode in a server action (logic)"
   },
   "contract": [
    "verbs.verbs.create",
    "verbs.verbs.set",
    "logic.nativeNodes.ISendEmailNode"
   ],
   "depends": [],
   "alternatives": [],
   "guidance": "The email body is a screen-like tree of widgets; its inputs are parameters (logic). A popup needs the variable that ShowPopup reads and the actions that change it.",
